WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.151
Fifteen times ten to the ten has a number part that's too big.

2
00:00:04.927 --> 00:00:07.602
Fifteen is too big for the number part.

3
00:00:08.405 --> 00:00:12.855
Fifteen is one point five times ten. That adds one to the power.

4
00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.670
One point five times ten to the eleven.
